.el .ds Aq '
.TH PDFLUENT-REDACT 1  "pdfluent 1.1.0" PDFluent
.SH NAME
pdfluent\-redact \- Permanently remove text or regions, not just cover them
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpdfluent redact\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] <\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-out\fR> [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-search\fR] [\fB\-\-regex\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-boxes\fR] [\fB\-\-case\-sensitive\fR] [\fB\-\-pages\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIINPUT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Permanently remove text or regions, not just cover them
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON envelope on stdout
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-out\fR \fI<OUT>\fR
Output PDF, or `\-` for stdout
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Quiet: human mode prints data only (no warnings or progress notes)
.TP
\fB\-\-search\fR \fI<TEXT>\fR
Literal text to redact everywhere it appears
.TP
\fB\-\-regex\fR \fI<RE>\fR
Regular expression to redact
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Verbose stderr diagnostics (repeat for more)
.TP
\fB\-\-boxes\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
JSON boxes file: `[{"page": 1, "rect": [x0, y0, x1, y1]}]` (points, 1\-based pages) or `{"boxes": [...]}`
.TP
\fB\-\-case\-sensitive\fR
Case\-sensitive text matching
.TP
\fB\-\-pages\fR \fI<PAGES>\fR
Limit text search to pages, e.g. `1\-3,5`
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Overwrite the existing output file
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIINPUT\fR>
Input PDF, or `\-` for stdin
.SH VERSION
v1.1.0
